{"name": "nights/berserk-c81-p01", "created": 1789560181.950896, "updated": 1789560325.8858051, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "30de5e87", "current": "7c5e8fcf", "nodes": {"30de5e87": {"id": "30de5e87", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "corrections to the residents' edition\n\npage 8, third line. for east read west. the gate has not been moved.\npage 19, footnote. for widow read wife. the certificate arrived after printing.\npage 31, second paragraph. delete the sentence beginning nobody remembers. we have received a letter.\npage 44. the blank space is of the correct dimensions and should not be filled by hand.\n\nseveral copies have been returned with the same correction on page 45. in each case\n", "ts": 1789560181.950895, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "f647a180": {"id": "f647a180", "parent": "30de5e87", "kind": "model", "text": "the word was was substituted for that was, so we will not change the original.\nhowever, the last two paragraphs have been divided differently for ease of reading.", "ts": 1789560184.969167, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 34, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "edc6aa28": {"id": "edc6aa28", "parent": "30de5e87", "kind": "model", "text": "the person has taken it upon him or her-self to delete a paragraph from the list of\nnew members and substitute another paragraph of their own composition.\n\npage 51.", "ts": 1789560187.976162, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "a362552d": {"id": "a362552d", "parent": "30de5e87", "kind": "model", "text": "the person who sent us the corrected copy has told us that there were other mistakes\nbut they had been unable to find them.\n\nWe would be glad if readers would let us", "ts": 1789560190.974921, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"note": "the thought that you could have got hold of it, but it would have been impossible, wouldn't it, and anyway, I was very careful to tear it into the smallest pieces before putting it in", "used": "opus"}}}, "b7fa2775": {"id": "b7fa2775", "parent": "30de5e87", "kind": "model", "text": "the handwriting is the same.\n\nthe first line is now a paragraph break; please type in a single space to separate this sentence from the last paragraph, rather than using multiple", "ts": 1789560193.9693031, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "f69449d3": {"id": "f69449d3", "parent": "30de5e87", "kind": "model", "text": "it is a genuine copy of the book.", "ts": 1789560194.845948, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 10, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "4e890c9a": {"id": "4e890c9a", "parent": "a362552d", "kind": "model", "text": " know any others they spot so that we can\nrectify the error on all future copies of this issue.\n\nThe printed word, once in print, takes on an air of", "ts": 1789560215.75542, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "927b3c8d": {"id": "927b3c8d", "parent": "a362552d", "kind": "model", "text": " know if any of this is wrong or misleading,\nso that we may make amends where we need to, either on these pages or on\nthose to come. We have", "ts": 1789560218.749619, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"note": "the sentence that says there were other mistakes but they had been unable to find them. I mean, I'm all for making mistakes and fixing them, but I really really hope there weren't more mistakes", "used": "opus"}}}, "39accf73": {"id": "39accf73", "parent": "a362552d", "kind": "model", "text": " know what others there may be so that\nwe can make them right next time. We apologize for having failed to give sufficient\ntime to the proof reading process.\n\nJOH", "ts": 1789560221.745538, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "d71fe9c9": {"id": "d71fe9c9", "parent": "a362552d", "kind": "model", "text": " know if there are any errors, so that we\ncan put the corrections on these pages.\n__________\n\npage 5, fifth line from the bottom, delete the comma at", "ts": 1789560224.742222, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "a6e3b06c": {"id": "a6e3b06c", "parent": "a362552d", "kind": "model", "text": " know any further corrections they think are\nneeded, especially in this copy, so that the errors may be noted when the edition is re-\nprinted. The copy sent out", "ts": 1789560227.7417548, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "0856f8a5": {"id": "0856f8a5", "parent": "927b3c8d", "kind": "model", "text": " been pleased with how much feedback we've already had,", "ts": 1789560243.8986082, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 12, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "8d7cb7d3": {"id": "8d7cb7d3", "parent": "927b3c8d", "kind": "model", "text": " had very little response from people whose families\nwere in the village when we started collecting the names but would like to\nhear from as many of them as possible. It", "ts": 1789560246.905066, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 35, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "904147e8": {"id": "904147e8", "parent": "927b3c8d", "kind": "model", "text": " also noticed several places where it could have been better.", "ts": 1789560247.956921, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 12, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 35, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "6b09b156": {"id"